---
import Figure from '../Figure.astro';
---
<Figure id="d-release-journey">
<svg viewBox="0 0 760 480" role="img" aria-label="How a release reaches people. The developer packs and signs a release, whose manifest states its outbound destinations, guests, instanceOrg and uses; runs meroctl app check against the last release, which in a release workflow fails on new egress; ships it with meroctl app release; and offers it in a deployment with meroctl deployment offer, setting the deployment's secrets. The cluster records the release with its pinned signer, and the offer. A customer creates an instance from the offer in their organization; the members its release uses with mode create are made with it, a unit, billed to the developer. The instance's grants decide who reaches it: the organization, teams, named members, guests, anyone signed in, visitors over public links. When the developer offers a newer release, the app's frontend reads GET /apps/&#123;app&#125;/update with the classifier's verdict over the unit and opens the consent page; the customer's update policy decides whether a green update applies on its own after its hold or an owner or admin approves, with a second approver for red where asked; every upgrade takes a restore point and can be undone for seven days." xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
  <defs><marker id="rj-arrow" markerWidth="9" markerHeight="9" refX="6.5" refY="3" orient="auto"><path d="M0,0 L6.5,3 L0,6 Z" fill="#8b949e"/></marker></defs>
  <rect x="0" y="0" width="760" height="480" rx="10" fill="#0f0f16"/>
  <text x="380" y="24" text-anchor="middle" fill="#c9d1d9" font-family="'JetBrains Mono', monospace" font-size="11" font-weight="700">From a signed release to the people who use it</text>

  <!-- lanes -->
  <g class="seq-step" style="--step-i:0">
    <rect x="14" y="38" width="236" height="428" rx="6" fill="#231708" stroke="#f0883e" stroke-opacity=".6"/>
    <text x="132" y="56" text-anchor="middle" fill="#f0883e" font-family="'JetBrains Mono', monospace" font-size="10" font-weight="700">developer</text>
    <rect x="262" y="38" width="236" height="428" rx="6" fill="#161b22" stroke="#58a6ff" stroke-opacity=".6"/>
    <text x="380" y="56" text-anchor="middle" fill="#58a6ff" font-family="'JetBrains Mono', monospace" font-size="10" font-weight="700">cluster (the log)</text>
    <rect x="510" y="38" width="236" height="428" rx="6" fill="#10210f" stroke="#3fb950" stroke-opacity=".6"/>
    <text x="628" y="56" text-anchor="middle" fill="#3fb950" font-family="'JetBrains Mono', monospace" font-size="10" font-weight="700">customer organization</text>
  </g>

  <!-- 1 pack -->
  <g class="seq-step" style="--step-i:1">
    <rect x="26" y="70" width="212" height="52" rx="5" fill="#10151c" stroke="#444c56"/>
    <text x="132" y="87" text-anchor="middle" fill="#c9d1d9" font-family="'JetBrains Mono', monospace" font-size="9" font-weight="700">1 · app pack (signed .mpk)</text>
    <text x="132" y="101" text-anchor="middle" fill="#8b949e" font-family="'JetBrains Mono', monospace" font-size="8">outbound · guests · instanceOrg</text>
    <text x="132" y="113" text-anchor="middle" fill="#8b949e" font-family="'JetBrains Mono', monospace" font-size="8">uses (create | attach)</text>
  </g>
  <!-- 2 check -->
  <g class="seq-step" style="--step-i:2">
    <line x1="132" y1="122" x2="132" y2="134" stroke="#8b949e" stroke-width="1" marker-end="url(#rj-arrow)"/>
    <rect x="26" y="138" width="212" height="52" rx="5" fill="#10151c" stroke="#a5ff11"/>
    <text x="132" y="155" text-anchor="middle" fill="#c9d1d9" font-family="'JetBrains Mono', monospace" font-size="9" font-weight="700">2 · app check --against last</text>
    <text x="132" y="169" text-anchor="middle" fill="#8b949e" font-family="'JetBrains Mono', monospace" font-size="8">green / red, where data can go</text>
    <text x="132" y="181" text-anchor="middle" fill="#8b949e" font-family="'JetBrains Mono', monospace" font-size="8">CI gate: --fail-on egress</text>
  </g>
  <!-- 3 release -->
  <g class="seq-step" style="--step-i:3">
    <line x1="132" y1="190" x2="132" y2="202" stroke="#8b949e" stroke-width="1" marker-end="url(#rj-arrow)"/>
    <rect x="26" y="206" width="212" height="40" rx="5" fill="#10151c" stroke="#444c56"/>
    <text x="132" y="223" text-anchor="middle" fill="#c9d1d9" font-family="'JetBrains Mono', monospace" font-size="9" font-weight="700">3 · app release --publish</text>
    <text x="132" y="237" text-anchor="middle" fill="#8b949e" font-family="'JetBrains Mono', monospace" font-size="8">pack, publish, install</text>
    <line x1="238" y1="226" x2="270" y2="226" stroke="#8b949e" stroke-width="1" marker-end="url(#rj-arrow)"/>
    <rect x="274" y="206" width="212" height="40" rx="5" fill="#10151c" stroke="#58a6ff"/>
    <text x="380" y="223" text-anchor="middle" fill="#c9d1d9" font-family="'JetBrains Mono', monospace" font-size="9">InstallPackage</text>
    <text x="380" y="237" text-anchor="middle" fill="#8b949e" font-family="'JetBrains Mono', monospace" font-size="8">signer pinned, manifest kept</text>
  </g>
  <!-- 4 offer -->
  <g class="seq-step" style="--step-i:4">
    <line x1="132" y1="246" x2="132" y2="258" stroke="#8b949e" stroke-width="1" marker-end="url(#rj-arrow)"/>
    <rect x="26" y="262" width="212" height="40" rx="5" fill="#10151c" stroke="#444c56"/>
    <text x="132" y="279" text-anchor="middle" fill="#c9d1d9" font-family="'JetBrains Mono', monospace" font-size="9" font-weight="700">4 · deployment offer</text>
    <text x="132" y="293" text-anchor="middle" fill="#8b949e" font-family="'JetBrains Mono', monospace" font-size="8">and the deployment's secrets</text>
    <line x1="238" y1="282" x2="270" y2="282" stroke="#8b949e" stroke-width="1" marker-end="url(#rj-arrow)"/>
    <rect x="274" y="262" width="212" height="40" rx="5" fill="#10151c" stroke="#58a6ff"/>
    <text x="380" y="279" text-anchor="middle" fill="#c9d1d9" font-family="'JetBrains Mono', monospace" font-size="9">OfferApp</text>
    <text x="380" y="293" text-anchor="middle" fill="#8b949e" font-family="'JetBrains Mono', monospace" font-size="8">one release per app name</text>
  </g>
  <!-- 5 instance -->
  <g class="seq-step" style="--step-i:5">
    <rect x="522" y="70" width="212" height="52" rx="5" fill="#10151c" stroke="#444c56"/>
    <text x="628" y="87" text-anchor="middle" fill="#c9d1d9" font-family="'JetBrains Mono', monospace" font-size="9" font-weight="700">5 · an instance from the offer</text>
    <text x="628" y="101" text-anchor="middle" fill="#8b949e" font-family="'JetBrains Mono', monospace" font-size="8">POST /apps &#123; deployment &#125;</text>
    <text x="628" y="113" text-anchor="middle" fill="#8b949e" font-family="'JetBrains Mono', monospace" font-size="8">in their org (instanceOrg)</text>
    <line x1="522" y1="96" x2="490" y2="132" stroke="#8b949e" stroke-width="1" marker-end="url(#rj-arrow)"/>
    <rect x="274" y="136" width="212" height="52" rx="5" fill="#10151c" stroke="#a371f7"/>
    <text x="380" y="153" text-anchor="middle" fill="#c9d1d9" font-family="'JetBrains Mono', monospace" font-size="9">CreateApp, a unit</text>
    <text x="380" y="167" text-anchor="middle" fill="#8b949e" font-family="'JetBrains Mono', monospace" font-size="8">members from uses (create)</text>
    <text x="380" y="179" text-anchor="middle" fill="#8b949e" font-family="'JetBrains Mono', monospace" font-size="8">billed to the developer</text>
  </g>
  <!-- 6 grants -->
  <g class="seq-step" style="--step-i:6">
    <line x1="628" y1="122" x2="628" y2="134" stroke="#8b949e" stroke-width="1" marker-end="url(#rj-arrow)"/>
    <rect x="522" y="138" width="212" height="64" rx="5" fill="#10151c" stroke="#3fb950"/>
    <text x="628" y="155" text-anchor="middle" fill="#c9d1d9" font-family="'JetBrains Mono', monospace" font-size="9" font-weight="700">6 · grants: who reaches it</text>
    <text x="628" y="169" text-anchor="middle" fill="#8b949e" font-family="'JetBrains Mono', monospace" font-size="8">org · team · named member</text>
    <text x="628" y="181" text-anchor="middle" fill="#8b949e" font-family="'JetBrains Mono', monospace" font-size="8">guest · anyone signed in</text>
    <text x="628" y="193" text-anchor="middle" fill="#8b949e" font-family="'JetBrains Mono', monospace" font-size="8">visitors over a public link</text>
  </g>
  <!-- 7 update offered -->
  <g class="seq-step" style="--step-i:7">
    <line x1="238" y1="290" x2="270" y2="330" stroke="#8b949e" stroke-width="1" stroke-dasharray="3 3" marker-end="url(#rj-arrow)"/>
    <text x="150" y="326" fill="#8b949e" font-family="'JetBrains Mono', monospace" font-size="8">a newer offer</text>
    <rect x="274" y="318" width="212" height="52" rx="5" fill="#10151c" stroke="#58a6ff"/>
    <text x="380" y="335" text-anchor="middle" fill="#c9d1d9" font-family="'JetBrains Mono', monospace" font-size="9">GET /apps/&#123;app&#125;/update</text>
    <text x="380" y="349" text-anchor="middle" fill="#8b949e" font-family="'JetBrains Mono', monospace" font-size="8">available + the class of the unit</text>
    <text x="380" y="361" text-anchor="middle" fill="#8b949e" font-family="'JetBrains Mono', monospace" font-size="8">policy, approvals needed</text>
    <line x1="486" y1="344" x2="518" y2="344" stroke="#8b949e" stroke-width="1" marker-end="url(#rj-arrow)"/>
    <rect x="522" y="318" width="212" height="52" rx="5" fill="#10151c" stroke="#3fb950"/>
    <text x="628" y="335" text-anchor="middle" fill="#c9d1d9" font-family="'JetBrains Mono', monospace" font-size="9" font-weight="700">7 · the app's update banner</text>
    <text x="628" y="349" text-anchor="middle" fill="#8b949e" font-family="'JetBrains Mono', monospace" font-size="8">opens the consent page;</text>
    <text x="628" y="361" text-anchor="middle" fill="#8b949e" font-family="'JetBrains Mono', monospace" font-size="8">owner or admin decides</text>
  </g>
  <!-- 8 policy -->
  <g class="seq-step" style="--step-i:8">
    <line x1="628" y1="370" x2="628" y2="382" stroke="#8b949e" stroke-width="1" marker-end="url(#rj-arrow)"/>
    <rect x="522" y="386" width="212" height="66" rx="5" fill="#10151c" stroke="#e3b341"/>
    <text x="628" y="403" text-anchor="middle" fill="#c9d1d9" font-family="'JetBrains Mono', monospace" font-size="9" font-weight="700">8 · their update policy</text>
    <text x="628" y="417" text-anchor="middle" fill="#8b949e" font-family="'JetBrains Mono', monospace" font-size="8">green: on its own after the hold</text>
    <text x="628" y="429" text-anchor="middle" fill="#8b949e" font-family="'JetBrains Mono', monospace" font-size="8">red: approved (second approver)</text>
    <text x="628" y="441" text-anchor="middle" fill="#8b949e" font-family="'JetBrains Mono', monospace" font-size="8">restore point · undo for 7 days</text>
    <line x1="522" y1="419" x2="490" y2="419" stroke="#8b949e" stroke-width="1" marker-end="url(#rj-arrow)"/>
    <rect x="274" y="396" width="212" height="46" rx="5" fill="#10151c" stroke="#58a6ff"/>
    <text x="380" y="414" text-anchor="middle" fill="#c9d1d9" font-family="'JetBrains Mono', monospace" font-size="9">UpgradeApp</text>
    <text x="380" y="428" text-anchor="middle" fill="#8b949e" font-family="'JetBrains Mono', monospace" font-size="8">only to what the deployment offers</text>
  </g>
</svg>
</Figure>
